  "prefLabel": "En 1012.04 Public Availability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.04 Public Availability.\n\n(a) Once the utility has notified the applicant of eligibility to participate in a group study the utility shall publish on its website the following:\n\n(1) The name of the group;\n\n(2) The number of projects in the group;\n\n(3) The application identification and export capacity of each project in the group;\n\n(4) The relevant substation for the group, the deadline for group formation, and date of execution of group study agreement; and\n\n(5) Date of completion of group study.\n\n(b) Any facility that is eligible for the group study shall be included on the utility’s website within 10 business days. The utility shall update this information monthly.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
